      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"ds-category\">Systems lens</span><h3>Fault Injection Engineer</h3><p>A system’s real character appears when a dependency fails.</p><div class=\"ds-row\"><span>Provocation</span><p>What if daily admin needed a circuit breaker?</p></div></article>",
